 "text": "The", "start": 103.676, "end": 103.796}, {"i": 266, "text": "same", "start": 103.836, "end": 104.136}, {"i": 267, "text": "for", "start": 104.196, "end": 104.336}, {"i": 268, "text": "all", "start": 104.456, "end": 104.617}, {"i": 269, "text": "of", "start": 104.657, "end": 104.697}, {"i": 270, "text": "us", "start": 104.797, "end": 104.877}, {"i": 271, "text": "at", "start": 104.937, "end": 104.997}, {"i": 272, "text": "this", "start": 105.017, "end": 105.177}, {"i": 273, "text": "time", "start": 105.217, "end": 105.457}, {"i": 274, "text": "of", "start": 105.497, "end": 105.557}, {"i": 275, "text": "year.", "start": 105.597, "end": 105.838}, {"i": 276, "text": "Take", "start": 106.418, "end": 106.618}, {"i": 277, "text": "care,", "start": 106.678, "end": 106.919}, {"i": 278, "text": "Emil.", "start": 106.979, "end": 107.339}, {"i": 279, "text": "Thank", "start": 107.459, "end": 107.619}, {"i": 280, "text": "you,", "start": 107.639, "end": 107.739}, {"i": 281, "text": "Doctor.", "start": 107.759, "end": 108.079}, {"i": 282, "text": "Goodbye.", "start": 108.38, "end": 108.7}], "segments": [{"start": 0.066, "end": 0.746, "text": "Good afternoon."}, {"start": 1.526, "end": 2.947, "text": "My name is Emil Iverson."}, {"start": 3.667, "end": 5.347, "text": "I have not been to this clinic before."}, {"start": 6.648, "end": 7.528, "text": "Welcome, Emil."}, {"start": 8.148, "end": 9.149, "text": "I am Dr. Winther."}, {"start": 9.469, "end": 10.229, "text": "Please sit down."}, {"start": 10.889, "end": 12.79, "text": "Did you find your way here without trouble?"}, {"start": 13.65, "end": 14.11, "text": "Mostly."}, {"start": 14.85, "end": 17.171, "text": "The roadworks on the main street held me up a little."}, {"start": 18.031, "end": 19.632, "text": "They have been at it for weeks now."}, {"start": 20.172, "end": 21.752, "text": "I leave earlier than I used to."}, {"start": 22.452, "end": 24.173, "text": "So, what brings you in today?"}, {"start": 25.293, "end": 28.234, "text": "Well, I am allergic to wasps."}, {"start": 28.726, "end": 31.328, "text": "and I keep worrying about what happens if I get stung."}, {"start": 32.369, "end": 33.39, "text": "Thank you for telling me."}, {"start": 34.07, "end": 36.532, "text": "And what were you hoping we could do about that today?"}, {"start": 36.553, "end": 39.595, "text": "I would like a prescription for an EpiPen."}, {"start": 40.376, "end": 42.017, "text": "Is that a reasonable thing to ask for?"}, {"start": 43.178, "end": 44.599, "text": "It is entirely reasonable."}, {"start": 45.14, "end": 47.422, "text": "Let me explain the reasoning, step by step."}, {"start": 48.222, "end": 48.763, "text": "Please do."}, {"start": 49.723, "end": 54.227, "text": "With a wasp allergy, there is a risk of a severe reaction across the whole body."}, {"start": 54.848, "end": 57.41, "text": "The medical word for that is anaphylaxis."}, {"start": 58.674, "end": 59.614, "text": "Anaphylaxis."}, {"start": 60.395, "end": 62.175, "text": "That is the dangerous kind, is it not?"}, {"start": 63.335, "end": 64.896, "text": "It is the serious kind, yes."}, {"start": 65.576, "end": 69.617, "text": "That risk is precisely why an adrenaline pen is the right thing for you."}, {"start": 70.757, "end": 71.178, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 71.978, "end": 73.198, "text": "And what strength would it be?"}, {"start": 74.218, "end": 77.659, "text": "I am prescribing an EpiPen of 0.3 milligrams."}, {"start": 78.2, "end": 79.28, "text": "Does that make sense to you?"}, {"start": 80.46, "end": 81.06, "text": "I think so."}, {"start": 81.861, "end": 84.441, "text": "I suppose I am still nervous that something could happen."}, {"start": 85.462, "end": 86.482, "text": "That is understandable."}, {"start": 87.102, "end": 89.224, "text": "Is there anything else you would like me to go through?"}, {"start": 90.365, "end": 90.585, "text": "No."}, {"start": 91.225, "end": 92.847, "text": "I think you have covered what I came for."}, {"start": 94.048, "end": 94.348, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 95.009, "end": 97.351, "text": "It really is getting dark early now, is it not?"}, {"start": 98.552, "end": 98.912, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 99.632, "end": 102.435, "text": "I leave work and it already feels like the middle of the evening."}, {"start": 103.676, "end": 105.838, "text": "The same for all of us at this time of year."}, {"start": 106.418, "end": 107.339, "text": "Take care, Emil."}, {"start": 107.459, "end": 108.079, "text": "Thank you, Doctor."}, {"start": 108.38, "end": 108.7, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.034}}